cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use LEAF-EB in research, please cite the software using this metadata.
title: >-
  LEAF-EB: Long-term Energy Analysis Framework - Electricity Balance
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Merino Rodríguez
    given-names: Iván
version: 2026.08.27
date-released: 2026-08-27
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  LEAF-EB constructs and evaluates long-term electricity scenarios from
  user-defined or externally derived assumptions at daily or hourly resolution
  while retaining temporal patterns relevant to storage, commodity conversion,
  nuclear operation, refueling and Monte Carlo analysis.
